 heights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Swing through the world with a <strong>Grappling-Hook</strong> made of flexible spider silk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Blind the minions of the metal menace using Lumi's <strong>firefly abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Charge yourself with electricity to <strong>defy gravity</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Funding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The development of this game's concept was funded by &quot;FilmFernsehFonds Bayern&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/extras/c2ab957d994d91f7413421a60aab241e.avif?t=1764172066\" alt=\"\"width=552 height=140 /></span></p>","developers":["Memory Forge"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604920/f627ef54e2795965255c7f798aef4679808286bf/header.jpg?t=1764172066","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3604920/856890/32a6f8f0364e608507d4bccc4e0c0c2b2f24d0cd/1750449283/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743040259","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3604920/856890/32a6f8f0364e608507d4bccc4e0c0c2b2f24d0cd/1750449283/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743040259","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3604920/856890/32a6f8f0364e608507d4bccc4e0c0c2b2f24d0cd/1750449283/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743040259","id":257118045,"name":"Incredibug Tech Demo Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118045/94a5eddd5ba75f876756b467048aad8b2fc1e30c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=17